    <string name="settings_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Only SMS from banks are read, and only on this phone. Bank messages are stored here so you can see where a transaction came from; personal messages are never stored. There are no ads, no analytics and no accounts. Backups and exports are files you choose where to save.</string>
